  "notes": "Action first, words second. Joker, Penguin and Riddler own the alley until the signal comes on. Batman drops in, says four words, throws once, leaves through the screen. Robin shows up late and chases him. v4: villains already gloating at frame 0 (hook card 'Three villains. One bat.'), signal at 1.4 s, Robin comes back to deliver the CTA in his voice. Alt hooks: 'Gotham. 1 A.M.' / 'Wrong alley.'",
